    "description": {
      "value": "Carved of seashell, a torrent spellgun is damp to the touch, and seaweed wraps around its grip. You Activate the spellgun by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This spellgun has a range increment of 30 feet. The spellgun blasts a powerful jet of water that deals bludgeoning damage based on the spellgun's type, then disintegrates into sand.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target takes double damage and is knocked back 10 feet.\n- **Success:** The target takes full damage and is knocked back 5 feet.\n\nThe damage is 2d6.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Components Interact, Strike"
